          "description": "Carry out a reply or deletion prepared with prepare_inbox_action. Pass its confirmToken with the same itemId, action and text (and workspaceId, if you used one); anything different is rejected. Call it only after the user has seen the preview and said yes in the conversation. Replies on Threads cannot be removed through PostFast, private replies cannot be unsent, and deletions cannot be undone. A token expires 15 minutes after it was prepared and works once. Failures return the underlying inbox.* codes (for example replyTooLong, privateReplyAlreadySent, deleteNotSupported).",
